The implementation has been rewritten in native Omega. The framed command
interface is new; the original Rust library ABI is not provided.
SHA-256, record validation and comparison execute inside the seeded Omega
executable. Rust/C/Python are used only by the separate test infrastructure.
No model weights or third-party model implementation are included here.
